              "text": "в случае (v slúchaye) — \"in case of, in the event of\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В случае дождя концерт будет в зале. V slúchaye dozhdyá kontsért búdet v zále. In case of rain the concert will be in the hall."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В случае + genitive: в случае (v slúchaye) дождя. Before a clause, в случае (v slúchaye) если…"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "в случае (v slúchaye) is в \"in\" with the prepositional of случай \"an event, a chance\", inherited from Proto-Slavic sŭlučajĭ, from lučiti, tentatively \"to find, to reach\" (EtymDB)."
